<title>CHINA: China raised jet fuel price to 2,750 yuan/t.</title>
<headline>China raised jet fuel price to 2,750 yuan/t.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>China has raised its domestic jet fuel price by 250 yuan per tonne to 2,750 yuan, effective March 1, Hu Yaoqing, vice president of state monopoly China Aviation Oil Supply Corp said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
